@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor Black
skinparam ActorBorderColor Black
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor Black
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor White
skinparam SequenceBoxBorderColor Black
skinparam SequenceBoxBackgroundColor White

actor User
participant "deploy-chuuk.sh" as Script
participant "Azure CLI" as AZ
participant "Key Vault" as KV
participant "ACR" as ACR
participant "Container Apps Env" as CAE
participant "Cosmos DB" as COSMOS
participant "Container App: Ollama" as OLLAMA
participant "Container App: Main" as MAIN

User -> Script: run script
Script -> AZ: az account show
AZ --> Script: login ok
Script -> AZ: az group create (RG)
Script -> AZ: az keyvault show (KV)
AZ --> Script: vault info
Script -> KV: get secret flask-secret-key
Script -> KV: get secret google-cloud-api-key
Script -> AZ: az provider register Microsoft.App/OperationalInsights
Script -> AZ: az acr show/create (ACR)
Script -> ACR: build/push main image
Script -> ACR: build/push ollama image
Script -> AZ: az containerapp env show/create (CAE)
Script -> AZ: az cosmosdb keys list (COSMOS)
Script -> AZ: az containerapp create/update (OLLAMA)
AZ -> OLLAMA: deploy image, internal ingress
Script -> AZ: az containerapp show (OLLAMA FQDN)
Script -> AZ: az containerapp create/update (MAIN) with env vars
note over Script,AZ
  COSMOS_DB_URI/KEY
  DB_TYPE=cosmos
  FLASK_ENV=production
  FLASK_DEBUG=0
  FLASK_SECRET_KEY
  GOOGLE_CLOUD_API_KEY
  OLLAMA_BASE_URL (from OLLAMA FQDN)
end note
AZ -> MAIN: deploy image, external ingress
note over OLLAMA,MAIN
  OLLAMA: internal ingress, 2 vCPU / 4Gi, min=1 max=1
  MAIN: external ingress, 2 vCPU / 4Gi, min=0 max=2
end note
MAIN -> OLLAMA: calls via OLLAMA_BASE_URL
User <-- Script: outputs URLs and log commands
@enduml
